  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to the Office of the Special Envoy for Syria to ensure that the Syrian-led, Syrian-owned Constitutional Committee, convened under United Nations auspices and facilitated by the UN Special Envoy for Syria, has the means to prepare and draft for popular approval a constitutional reform as a contribution to the political settlement in Syria and the implementation of Security Council Resolution 2254 (2015)</narrative>
